; ============================================================ ; the passes: one to instantiate and then one per
                                                               ; generate
                                                               ; INSTANTIATE IS THE ZEROTH GENERATE  and that is the
                                                               ; whole trick of this file; Update over the seed and
                                                               ; the Update that ends a generate are the same pair
                                                               ; loop  so putting the instantiate INSIDE the generate
                                                               ; loop as a pass that makes no output leaves ONE pair
                                                               ; loop and therefore one paste; the count is ngen plus
                                                               ; one for that pass
