  [->>>>>>>>>+<<<<<<<<<]
>>>>                                                           ; move b0 into the addend
  [->>>>>>+<<<<<<]
>>>>>                                                          ; to the kernel's base  which is where a paste site
                                                               ; always stands
                                                               ; ASSERT ptr=1677
  >                                                            ; walk in to this routine entry offset
