; ============================================================ ; ; ; the constants ROTATE one word left  so the next
                                                               ; is
                                                               ; at the head A rotation and not a shift: after sixty
                                                               ; four rounds the table is back where it started  which
                                                               ; is what lets a second block use it again; the
